<title>ARGENTINA: Telefonica ups stake in Argentine unit.</title>
<headline>Telefonica ups stake in Argentine unit.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telefonica de Argentina said its parent company Telefonica de Espana Friday bought an extra 4.16 percent stake in its controlling holding Cointel from Bank of Tokyo Mitsubishi.</p>
<p>The deal raises Telefonica de Espana stake in Cointel to 50 percent, the Argentine firm told the Buenos Aires Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>It did not disclose the amount of the deal.</p>
</text>
